  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">R&#xe9;ponse d&apos;urgence int&#xe9;gr&#xe9;e pour les communaut&#xe9;s vuln&#xe9;rables affect&#xe9;es par les conflits arm&#xe9;s au Nord-Kivu et Sud-Kivu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide water, sanitation and hygiene, nutrition and education assistance to internally displaced persons, returnees, refugees and host community members in North and South Kivu. This UNICEF project provides access to safe drinking water, rehabilitates water points, constructs emergency showers and latrines, establishes temporary learning centres, screens for acute malnutrition and provides treatment to those suffering from severe acute malnutrition. This WASH component provides assistance to 108,000 people; the nutrition component to 5,900 people; and the education component to 4,400 people.</narrative>
  </description>
